     [38;5;246mSurvives reloads and restarts, shared across tabs. Stores an expiry timestamp so identity does not live forever. [39m
     [38;5;246mNeeds an explicit clear on logout.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m sessionStorage
     [38;5;246mPer-tab, cleared when the tab closes. Narrowest exposure and logout-on-close for free, but each tab needs its own [39m
     [38;5;246mlogin.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m localStorage, no expiry
     [38;5;246mSimplest persistent option. Identity stays until explicitly cleared, including across restarts.[39m
